abels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-07T18:01:08Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T17:14:03Z","closed_at":"2026-08-20T17:13:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nMaster 4.8 I think I am on commit 49f68a1\nCommit message says \"Merged pull request #121420 from vaner-org/tree-hide-sticky-during-drag\" by Thaddeus Crews\nI followed the guide to build Godot then generate C# bindings. \nI have Visual Studio 2022 and 2026. Godot opens 2026\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 64 bit\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot automatically changes the .csproj when I first open godot to change the sdk. I have to open godot, then edit the .csproj THEN I can use godot normally. So if godot crashes, or I close it to re open it, I have to once again go into the windows file explorer and edit the sdk config in the .csproj file. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nBuild Godot. Build C# bindings.\nHave a C# godot project. \nOpen the godot project with the custom Godot.\nObserve that the project sdk says:\n`<Project Sdk=\"Godot.NET.Sdk/4.8.0-dev\">`\non the first line. \nEdit this line to have a \".1\" at the end:\n`<Project Sdk=\"Godot.NET.Sdk/4.8.0-dev.1\">`\nEnjoy using Godot normally. \n\nClose Godot. \nRe open the exact same project. \nObserve the `.csproj` file was chaned BACK to \n`<Project Sdk=\"Godot.NET.Sdk/4.8.0-dev\">` and now you have to RE OPEN the windows file explorer, and fix it. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nC# Project with C# scripts so the C# project compiles. \nUse the \"Build\" or \"Play\" buttons (Alt + B) (F5) and observe. ","closed_by":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122193/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122193/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}